$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/4/verb_pp_01

::Q001::[markdown]Which Principal Part of ἐθέλω is ‘ἠθέληκα’?:{
	~%-100%2nd#Incorrect. **ἠθέληκα** is the 4th Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **ἠθέληκα** is the 4th Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 1st.
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **ἠθέληκα** is the 4th Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 5th.
	~%-100%6th#Incorrect. **ἠθέληκα** is the 4th Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 6th.
	~%100%4th#Correct: **ἠθέληκα** is the 4th Principal Part of **ἐθέλω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. **ἠθέληκα** is the 4th Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 3rd.
}


::Q002::[markdown]Pick the 4th Principal Part of παύω.:{
	~%-100%κεχόρευκα#Incorrect. **κεχόρευκα** is Principal Part 4 of **χορεύω** “dance” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%δεδήλωκα#Incorrect. **δεδήλωκα** is Principal Part 4 of **δηλόω** “make clear” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%κέκληκα#Incorrect. **κέκληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **καλέω** “call” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%τέθυκα#Incorrect. **τέθυκα** is Principal Part 4 of **θύω** “I sacrifice” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%πέπεικα#Incorrect. **πέπεικα** is Principal Part 4 of **πείθω** “persuade” (Chapter 5).
	~%100%πέπαυκα#Correct: **πέπαυκα** is the 4th Principal Part of **παύω** (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%γέγραφα#Incorrect. **γέγραφα** is Principal Part 4 of **γράφω** “write” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%τετελεύτηκα#Incorrect. **τετελεύτηκα** is Principal Part 4 of **τελευτάω** “finish” (Chapter 10).
}


