	~%-100%ἠξιώθην#Incorrect. **ἠξιώθην** is Principal Part 6 of **ἀξιόω** “think worthy of” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%λύω#Incorrect. **λύω** is Principal Part 1 of **λύω** “unbind” (Chapter 2).
	~%100%τάττω#Correct: **τάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **τάττω** “draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐπαύθην#Incorrect. **ἐπαύθην** is Principal Part 6 of **παύω** “stop” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%διδάσκω#Incorrect. **διδάσκω** is Principal Part 1 of **διδάσκω** “teach” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἠξίωσα#Incorrect. **ἠξίωσα** is Principal Part 3 of **ἀξιόω** “think worthy of” (Chapter 10).
}


